      "quote": "Citation: Hussain, S.; Riad, A.; Singh, A.; Klugarová, J.; Antony, B.; Banna, H.; Klugar, M. Global Prevalence of COVID-19-Associated Mucormycosis (CAM): Living Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis.",
      "reason": "The title explicitly contains the phrase “Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis,” identifying the report as a systematic review."
    },
